--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Based on / derived from
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

MeshChat64 is a Commodore 64 client for MeshChat and is based on, and
interoperates with, the MeshChat project by saint-cc:

    https://github.com/saint-cc/meshchat   (GNU GPL v3)

MeshChat64 is a modified/derivative work: it reimplements the MeshChat v1
wire protocol in 6502 assembly for the Commodore 64 and reuses MeshChat's
protocol design and identity/encryption scheme. The browser web client and
the public relay remain saint-cc's work; please use and credit the upstream
project for those. All original MeshChat copyright and license notices are
retained.

Per GPL v3 section 5: this is a modified version, first released in 2026 by
MykelSIlver, and is licensed in its entirety under GPL v3.

